## Why This Is Asked
Tests experience building production ML pipelines in AWS with strict data locality, latency targets, and privacy. Assesses ability to combine PrivateLink, Lake Formation, Feature Store, canary deployment, drift monitoring, and cost governance.

## Key Concepts
- SageMaker PrivateLink
- Lake Formation data access
- Feature Store
- Endpoint traffic splitting (canary)
- Drift detection & retraining triggers
- DP privacy controls and encryption

## Code Example
```javascript
// Example drift score calculation (KS statistic placeholder)
function ksDrift(p, q) {
  let max = 0;
  for (let i = 0; i < p.length; i++) {
    max = Math.max(max, Math.abs(p[i] - q[i]));
  }
  return max;
}
```

